# Permanent (301) redirects from the old site, riverheightschildcare.com,
# to the new site, riverheightsmontessori.ca. These only take effect once
# riverheightschildcare.com is added to this Netlify site as a domain alias.

# Let search engines read robots.txt directly on the old domain (no redirect),
# so Google's Change of Address checker can crawl the old URLs.
https://riverheightschildcare.com/robots.txt           /robots.txt                                       200!
