http://riverheightschildcare.com/robots.txt            /robots.txt                                       200!
http://www.riverheightschildcare.com/robots.txt        /robots.txt                                       200!

# Old homepage (every http/https and www combination) -> new homepage in one hop.
# Google's Change of Address check requires the first redirect to land on the new site.
http://riverheightschildcare.com/                      https://riverheightsmontessori.ca/                301!
http://www.riverheightschildcare.com/                  https://riverheightsmontessori.ca/                301!
https://www.riverheightschildcare.com/                 https://riverheightsmontessori.ca/                301!

